    {'para': '**409.** The root ⟨śī⟩ (mid.), ‘lie’, has *guṇa* throughout; thus, ⟨śaye⟩, ⟨śeṣe⟩, ⟨śete⟩, ⟨śevahe⟩ etc.; impf. ⟨aśayi⟩, ⟨aśethās⟩ etc.; opt. ⟨śayīya⟩ etc., part. ⟨śayāna⟩. Other irregularities are the 3rd persons pl.: indic. ⟨śerate⟩, imv. ⟨śeratām⟩, impf. ⟨aśerata⟩.'},
